  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ Bác Mai bắt được con gà mái””.<br>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ tung con xúc xắc được số chấm chia hết cho <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math>””&thinsp; suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ tung con xúc xắc được số chấm không chia hết cho <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math>””&thinsp; suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có  xác suất bắt được gà mái từ chuồng I là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có  xác suất bắt được gà mái từ chuồng II là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tÁp dụng công thức xác suất toàn phần ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>41</mn><mn>84</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy xác suất để bác Mai bắt được con gà mái là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>41</mn><mn>84</mn></mfrac></semantics></math>.",
